# select:file.directory on a flat repository returns the root as ./.
args: search 'repo:^github\.com/gorilla/mux$@v1.8.0 select:file.directory NewRouter'
exit: 0
--- stdout
1+ directories  1 repo  0.9 s
query  repo:^github\.com/gorilla/mux$@v1.8.0 select:file.directory NewRouter

github.com/gorilla/mux@98cb6bf42e08:./
--- stderr
sego: note: at a pinned revision, select: keeps only what each repository's first 30 matches hold; count:all gives every one
